            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to a tape sticking system for sticking a protective tape for protecting a peripheral portion of a substrate, such as a wafer. The tape sticking apparatus (10) includes a substrate holder (21) for sticking, a side roller (43), a first roller (46), a second roller (47), a roller-driving motor (49) coupled to the second roller (47), and a nipping mechanism (60) for nipping the peripheral portion of the substrate (W) with the first roller (46) and the second roller (47). The tape sticking apparatus (10) is configured to cause the second roller (47) to be rotated by use of the roller-driving motor (49) while nipping the peripheral portion of the substrate, held to the substrate holder (21) for sticking, with the first roller (46) and the second roller (47), to thereby rotate the substrate.</p>
            </abstract>
